Wheele is a multifunctional bike computer that lives right in your phone!

Wheele is designed to be convenient to use for both cycling enthusiastes and people who just want to try out biking. 
Wheele provides you with a rich set of features right in the palm of your hand:
- state-of-the-art tracking technology encorporating multiple clever technical solutions to keep the battery use to a minimum without sacrifising tracking accuracy;
- pause your trips during breaks and continue once you're ready to go;
- while you ride watch your route being drawn on the map with different colors representing different speed you're moving with;
- unlimited track history with the ability to delete tracks you don't need anymore;
- every track gets a thumbnail representing your whole trip so you can easily identify tracks on the track history screen;
- extensive track statistics including time, speed and distance - both in realtime while riding and while looking through historical data;
- watch your global account statisics grow - each track contributes towards total time, distance and other statistics aggregated over all your journeys.

To record tracks in Wheele you need an active subscription. Before purchasing, you may evaluate the app functionality by recording a couple of tracks for free.
Wheele has the following subscriptions:
- monthly;
- 3 months;
- a whole year.
Subscriptions don't have a free trial period but you may record your first few tracks without purchasing one. Every subscription allows you to record and store unlimited amount of tracks. You will keep access to the tracks you recorded even if you decide to cancel your subscription.
You may also make a one-time purchase that allows you to record exactly one track.
Current prices can be checked in the app and are subject to change without notice.

By using Wheele you agree to our Terms of Use (https://wheelgo.app/terms.html) and Privacy Policy (https://wheelgo.app/privacy-policy.html).

Should you have any difficulties please do not hesitate to contact us via support@wheelgo.app
